  "description": "Six fixed news sections (World, Technology, Business, Science, Arts, Finance) read through the shell's feed proxy. Opens on World with the device-local date and shows at most 10 headlines per section with plain-text summaries; tapping a headline opens the source article in a new tab. Keeps no state.",
